{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_judge_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_judge_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"為你撐傘","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_judge_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"4e543cff4957d9fd42a35594268fea699a2516b502e3ea429e1b313bec3c043d","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"沃爾西尼的事情結束後，拉維妮婭暫時收養了盧比奧的女兒——盧娜，而盧娜的狀況讓她有些擔憂……","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g8_srcroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我回來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……盧娜？你在嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"房間中並沒有傳來回應，而拉維妮婭環視了房間一圈後，在角落的書桌處找到了自己的目標。\n桌上擺滿了自己曾經讀過的書籍，而書籍的中央，是一個趴在那裡睡著了的女孩。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"睡著的女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"爸……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……盧娜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔……嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，吵醒你了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……睡著了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉維妮婭姐姐，我今天把這本書讀完了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在上面做的筆記我也都讀了，還寫了一些自己的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真了不起，我在學生時代，讀這本書花了一個月，而你花一星期就看完了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"反正休學了，乾脆就待在家裡自學了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉……新城市教育資源的調配還需要一些時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會盡快讓你去新的學校上學的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這又不是拉維妮婭姊姊你的錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"父親做了那樣的事，本來我也不想再在那所學校上學了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉維妮婭姐願意收留我，我應該感謝你才對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我答應了你父親要照顧你，而且，無論如何，我也不可能看著盧比奧閣下的女兒流落街頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……其實，不去上學我也無所謂的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"反正，誰都知道，我是盧比奧的女兒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……讀了一天書了，休息一下吧，我來煮飯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，我還不累。我也來幫忙。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g8_srcroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……拉維妮婭姐姐，你知道我為什麼會做菜嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"父親身為食品安全部部長，平時最常做的就兩件事：逛菜市場、幫家族的人煮飯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幫家族的人煮飯的時候，他通常還要陪客人，就沒辦法回來給我和媽媽做飯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"媽媽不喜歡煮飯，於是，他就把廚藝傳授給了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"家裡的飯很多時候都是我做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以前每次煮飯的時候，我都會在心裡把父親罵一頓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在也是。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"菜刀狠戾地劃過尚帶著露水的蔥，與砧板進行了親密的接觸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"父親真是笨死了，為什麼非得那麼做不可呢……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……盧娜，你還是不能原諒盧比奧閣下嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有什麼關係呢，我原不原諒他，他都回不來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……沒事的，盧娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會陪着你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起……我……不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……明天，我們去薩盧佐家族一趟，去結束這件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是他的女兒，所以法理上你有權利這樣做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，如果你實在不願意，我也不會勉強。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我會去的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"父親雖然是個笨蛋，但是，讓他的屍體就這樣被家族收著，未免有點太可憐了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，拉維妮婭姊姊你也不希望父親的事就這麼不了了之，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論如何，薩盧佐家族都需要給出一個說法。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g7_reception"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這不是沃爾西尼如今風頭正勁的大法官小姐嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以為阿爾貝托閣下會在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿爾貝托閣下已經不在沃爾西尼了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他料到您會上門索討盧比奧的遺體，所以特別吩咐我們，要好好招待您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，我沒想到，您居然真的帶著小盧娜來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我見過你，你是父親的下屬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還記得我嗎，太好了，叫我特麗莎就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是薩盧佐家族的人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，盧比奧也知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別擔心，拉維妮婭小姐，阿爾貝托閣下特別囑咐我們，這件事要做得漂亮一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"需要我親自登門索討盧比奧閣下的遺體，這也算是漂亮嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"話可不能這麼說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"盧比奧的死可是給薩盧佐帶來了大麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，抱歉，可憐的小盧娜，我並不是想要傷害你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對於我和我的大部分同事而言，盧比奧都是一個相當好相處的上司。對於他的死，我們也感到很痛心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們不是來跟你聊這些的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，法官小姐您不這麼覺得嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"盧比奧的演講也許很動聽，我至今也還記得那聲銃響。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是……在那之後已經過了一段時間，什麼都沒有改變。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我看來，一切照常。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只留下了一個失去了父親的孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小盧娜，這段時間，你過得還好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……拉維妮婭姐很照顧我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就好，那就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，法官小姐畢竟是新城市的重要人物，日理萬機，我看也沒太多時間能陪你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，你的父親多狠心啊，丟下你，就那麼沒有意義地死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你覺得父親的死沒有意義？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不願意對你說謊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算把新城市交給那位貝洛內家族的小少爺和我們可親的法官小姐，他們又能做到什麼呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"法官小姐，你們真的以為可以建立一個沒有家族的城市？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們不是來和你辯論的，特麗莎小姐，我們只是來要回盧比奧閣下的遺體的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，當然。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帶兩位去取盧比奧的遺體。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激進的家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟我來吧，兩位。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g5_srcpark"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"盧娜，別被她的話給迷惑住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她只是想要激怒我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激進的家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"話也不能這麼說，法官小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激進的家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特麗莎說得有沒有道理，你身為當事人，不是最清楚的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激進的家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管你和萊昂圖索小少爺怎麼看待自己，在我們看來，你們想做的事情，很可笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激進的家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道你們想靠著一兩句口號來戰勝家族嗎？還是說，你們覺得，西西里夫人真的看上你們了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g7_reception"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你覺得父親的死沒有意義？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不願意對你說謊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算把新城市交給那位貝洛內家族的小少爺和我們可親的法官小姐，他們又能做到什麼呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"法官小姐，你們真的以為可以建立一個沒有家族的城市？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g5_srcpark"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（低聲）對不起，拉維妮婭姊姊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你當然不會理解這種事，對家族的人而言，“公平”從一開始就不在你們的字典裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，即使現在要借助西西里夫人的力量，未來，我們也會讓她刮目相看的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激進的家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然你聽起來很有自信，不過，跟在你身邊的小姑娘，好像不這麼想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"盧娜……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"盧娜？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們把她怎麼了？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激進的家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"法官小姐，請你陪我們玩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們把盧娜怎麼了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激進的家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別誤會，法官小姐，我們並沒有對那個女孩怎麼樣，她是自己離開你的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激進的家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我們的任務，就是不讓你找到她。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g7_reception"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就知道你會回來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小盧娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來吧，讓我們再聊聊你的父親。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g5_srcpark"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們說什麼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激進的家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真的以為，薩盧佐家族會對現狀忍氣吞聲嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激進的家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們整個家族上下，對貝洛內、對你、對盧比奧可都是恨得牙癢癢啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你們設了這個局，想要用盧娜威脅我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激進的家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"威脅？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激進的家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖嘖，你還是不夠了解薩盧佐，法官小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激進的家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們都知道你是什麼樣的人，對付你這樣的人，就算當著你的面殺了你關心的人，也起不到報復的作用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激進的家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"得用些更特別的辦法才行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激進的家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"此時此刻，我們的小盧娜，應該已經回到特麗莎那裡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們，難道說——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們敢！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激進的家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，這就對了，法官小姐。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g7_reception"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不明白，為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼你們能那麼輕鬆地談論父親的死？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為對我們來說，一個人的生死，就是很簡單的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"昨天還在說笑的人，今天說不定就消失了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你以後也會習慣的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不想習慣這種事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，說不定你就會成為消失的那一個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那聲銃響也許讓你產生了一些誤解，誤以為你的父親死得很壯烈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是──再過幾天，再過幾個月，再過幾年，真的還有人能記得嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它遲早會消失在雨聲裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉維妮婭姐說了，她會記住，有些人會記住，這樣就足夠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你相信嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你真的相信，如果你毫不懷疑，為什麼你會來找我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也很懷疑，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算盧比奧的願望真的能實現，又要等到什麼時候？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你等得起嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或者說，你願意等嗎？我親愛的小盧娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別傻了，小盧娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你其實不理解盧比奧說的那些東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也不關心，你才幾歲，你怎麼可能真的懂那些？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要我說呢，你真正該恨的，難道不是我們的法官小姐嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她騙了你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她騙你要忍耐，她騙你盧比奧的話真的能實現。你說，有沒有可能，其實盧比奧會那麼做，就是她煽動的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的正義大法官，到底還要讓多少人為了她的正義而流血？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不許你這麼說拉維妮婭姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也懷疑過，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣吧，我們來做個交易。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們會把你父親的屍體交給法官小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，我們希望你能在之後的庭審中，替我們說幾句好話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"盧比奧是自殺的，和薩盧佐沒有什麼關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你們到底要貶低父親和拉維妮婭姐到什麼地步才肯善罷甘休？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"貶低？我只是在陳述事實而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道，你不恨拋下你不管的父親？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你錯了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我確實恨父親，我恨他就這麼把我丟下，一個人死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我也知道，我更該恨的，是你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是你們這些逼死他的家族！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"盧娜猛地打開背包，掏出藏在其中的手弩，對準了特麗莎。\n面對冰冷的弩箭，特麗莎的嘴角，卻掛上了笑容。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g5_srcpark"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們……從一開始，就想引誘盧娜殺了特麗莎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們瘋了？！竟然故意讓自己人去送死！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激進的家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們瘋了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激進的家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我們看來，盧比奧才瘋了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激進的家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為了自己那點不切實際的夢，把所有人都拖下了水。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們根本不理解盧比奧閣下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激進的家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們確實不理解，但我們理解要怎麼對付你這種人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激進的家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心吧，我們也不打算殺了你，只是，你也別想過去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激進的家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等時間差不多了，再去給特麗莎收屍就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼，特麗莎就甘願去死嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激進的家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她運氣不算好，當了盧比奧的手下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激進的家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，她死了，她的弟弟還有她那不成器的爹，能活下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激進的家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她也能為家族帶來榮譽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激進的家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果處理得當，說不定我們的小盧娜，能在未來頂替她的位置，多好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"盧娜是無辜的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激進的家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在過去，你有貝洛內的庇護，我們也就睜一隻眼閉一隻眼了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激進的家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，貝洛內沒了，老貝納爾多也死了，你真的以為，我們會放任你上位嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激進的家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從一開始，這就是一個針對你的局。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激進的家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，要怪，還是得怪你啊，法官小姐。你不該把她留在身邊的，這真的不是一個好選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"給我讓開——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激進的家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖嘖，不愧是讓許多家族聞風喪膽的法官，戰鬥力也是不容小覷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激進的家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只可惜，你只有一個人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那要是多幾個呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激進的家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼——？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉維妮婭，你還好吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊昂？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激進的家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這不是我們新沃爾西尼的大紅人，萊昂圖索少爺嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激進的家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是說，我應該叫你，萊昂圖索議員？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隨便你怎麼叫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼會——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽說你打算來索討盧比奧的遺體，就留了個心眼，派人看了一下這邊的狀況。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去吧，拉維妮婭，情況我大概知道了，這裡交給我，那個孩子……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有你能救她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激進的家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊昂圖索，就算多你一個又怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我既然要來，當然也做好準備了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激進的家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，德克薩斯也來了嗎……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激進的家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"攔住他們！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走這邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g7_reception"},{"type":"narration","text":"弩箭牢牢釘住特麗莎的衣角。\n盧娜死死地盯着特麗莎，特麗莎的臉上依然帶著笑意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"準頭還不錯，你幻想過很多次這樣的場景，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"閉嘴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，多好的眼神啊，小盧娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當我看到你的眼神的時候，我就知道，其實，你是屬於我們這邊的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，應該說，又有誰不是屬於我們這邊的呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個法官真的覺得自己比別人清高，比別人乾淨嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她的手上染了多少人的血？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而你的父親，他在廣播裡把自己說得那麼漂亮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他又對多少人的死熟視無睹？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不相信的，孩子，我們的手都是髒的，憑什麼你們覺得自己能夠造出乾淨的房子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"父親的手，還有拉維妮婭姐的手，都不髒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不准你再侮辱他們！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"盧娜繼續用弩箭對準特麗莎，但特麗莎沒有絲毫退縮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"侮辱？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是在陳述一個事實。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你真的憎恨把盧比奧逼死的家族……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，你有這個機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼，不敢了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你對你父親的感情，也不過如此嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"閉嘴！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"盧娜，住手！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"鋒利的弩箭穿透了拉維妮婭的肩膀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉維……妮婭姊姊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為……什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……對不起……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉維妮婭？！那些人在搞什麼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"職員特麗莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"冷靜，盧娜，放下你手裡的武器。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"拉維妮婭捂住自己的肩膀，緩慢而堅定地走向她。\n盧娜驚慌地想要後退，卻不知道自己該退往何處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她侮辱父親，她說──父親的死根本沒有意義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她也侮辱你，她說你做的事情毫無意義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她該死，像她一樣的家族的人，都該死！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"像她一樣的人，最終都會得到懲罰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，如果你殺了這個人，一切都結束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你向我借了那些書，不正是想要成為一個能公平審判他人的人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，但是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我每天都會夢到爸爸，每天都會夢到那聲銃響！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道我該怎麼辦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我拼命地學習，想要忘記這些，但是，我忘不了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我忘不了！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……誰又能忘記呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，你父親最不希望看到的一定是，我們因為衝動而忘了我們該做的事，應該走的路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他忍耐了幾十年，就是為了等待一個機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許他不希望你和我走上同一條道路，但是，我不能眼睜睜地看著你的雙手染上鮮血。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是我忍不住，我沒辦法……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我等不了那麼久……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想讓所有人都知道父親不是他們想的那樣……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"會有那一天的，我向你保證，盧娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那一天到來之前，我會一直陪著你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算這片大地沒有其他人相信你父親說的話，我也會相信，並且為此奮鬥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為那也是我最初的夢想。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"拉維妮婭走到盧娜身邊，緊緊地把這個已經淚流滿面的孩子抱在懷中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是你覺得實在無法忍受，就來找我吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會聽你抱怨，我會陪你哭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等你成年了，我們還可以一起喝一點酒，一起抱怨，一起承擔一個人吃不下的苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……真的可以嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然可以。但是，你也要答應我，你要學會忍耐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再讓你憤怒的事，你也要試著克制。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也想這麼做的，我也真的是這麼想的，但是，但是，對不起，對不起——嗚嗚，嗚啊啊啊啊啊啊！！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道的，我都知道。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"弩從手中跌落，原先緊握它的雙手，抱住了拉維妮婭。\n淚水再次從眼眶中湧出，但這次，沖走了憤怒，沖淡了仇恨。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g7_reception"},{"type":"narration","text":"良久，哭聲終於停止。\n拉維妮婭擦乾了盧娜的眼淚，然後扛起昏迷的特麗莎，和盧娜一起走向門外。\n走著走著，她忽然像是想起什麼一樣，說道——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我很抱歉，盧娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也好，你的父親也好，我們有意無意地，在要求你變成我們想要的樣子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我見過一些人，我知道，正義也好，公義也罷……並不是一個人唯一的出路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在很久以前，我剛開始工作沒多久……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那時，我也和你一樣，我希望我能讓那些家族意識到，他們不能為所欲為。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那天，我站在一條巷子口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不是有個人攔住我，我可能已經死在那條巷子裡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個人將一個盒子擺在我的面前，裡面裝著我手上的這副手套和鐵鎚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想，那時候我要是躲在他的身後，那我這一生，恐怕都沒辦法再獨立走下去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我拿起他給我的武器，走在了他的前面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在回想起來，他應該也是這麼期望的，他也希望我能做到這一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"家族的人總是這樣，他們往往把某個人或某一方的死亡當作解決一件事情的必然結果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這種建立在暴力之上的循環是他們生存的基礎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在漫長的日子裡，有無數個人在雨夜之中，走入一條無光的巷子，他們要麽死在裡面，要麽活著但雙手染血。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後，他們在巷子裡越走越遠，越走越深，逐漸忘了自己身處巷子之中，最後，他們以為，狹窄的巷子已經走得很開闊了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"敘拉古就是由狹窄的巷子組成的迷宮，即使是終點，也不過是一條窄路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而身處這座迷宮中的人，並沒有太多選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果只能在我這樣的人和那些家族之間做選擇，我情願強硬地把你留在我的身邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，你不必變成我，我也不希望你變成我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我更希望我能帶著你走出這座迷宮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"迷宮之外有什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"道路，許多寬廣的道路。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
